// control-sparse (t_678a4dab): a program whose ONLY colour output is COLOR1
// (register R2).  Two targets must be BOUND (targets are positional) but only
// c1 JUDGED; c0 receives whatever R0 held and is not evidence.  Painted pixels
// are counted on c1.  Reference-compiled by the stager.
void main(float4 tc : TEXCOORD0, out float4 c1 : COLOR1)
{
    c1 = float4(tc.x, tc.y, 0.5, 1.0);
}
